     "anchor": "Command the children of Israel",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 27:20",
       "ref": "EXO.27.20"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.3",
   "range": "LEV.24.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e7e2e4f6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.3#p1-e7e2e4f6",
     "text": "Which separated the holiest of holies, where the ark of the testimony from the sanctuary was.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "of the testimony"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.5",
   "range": "LEV.24.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b4271df6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.5#p1-b4271df6",
     "text": "That is, two omers, read Ex 16:16.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "tenth deals shall be in one",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 16:16",
       "ref": "EXO.16.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.7",
   "range": "LEV.24.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4951d2be",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.7#p1-4951d2be",
     "text": "For it was burnt every sabbath, when the bread was taken away.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "it may be on the bread"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.10",
   "range": "LEV.24.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "15d6e13c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.10#p1-15d6e13c",
     "text": "Meaning, out of his tent.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "out among the children of Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.11",
   "range": "LEV.24.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5786f0e3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.11#p1-5786f0e3",
     "text": "By swearing or despising God.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "blasphemed the name of the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.15",
   "range": "LEV.24.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4eae39e0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.15#p1-4eae39e0",
     "text": "Shall be punished.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "bear his sin"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.24.23",
   "range": "LEV.24.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "38483264",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.24.23#p1-38483264",
     "text": "Because the punishment was not yet appointed by the law for the blasphemer, Moses consulted with the Lord, and told the people what God commanded.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Moses spake to the children of"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
